{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/756183-inverting-the-racial-death-spiral","id":756183,"title":"Inverting the Racial Death Spiral","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-05T03:50:05-08:00","id":756183,"title":"Inverting the Racial Death Spiral","content":"As the setting stands going forward there are fewer and fewer first changes across most of the breeds. it creates a sense of being a part of a dying race. What if this gets abruptly inverted? There's a massive spike in first changes how do you see the setting changing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T04:06:31-08:00","id":756216,"title":"","content":"Varies from tribe to tribe. I think with the fenrir you'd see a surge in the front lines. Imagine the Amazon overrun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T04:29:06-08:00","id":756249,"title":"","content":"I'd imagine a lot would consider it a sign of Gaia's renewed favor and declare a glorious, full-on, fire-in-the-sky holy war. The Theurges would likely be wondering what caused it to happen, if it wasn't something obvious like an avatar of Gaia appearing and declaring it, and whether they can keep it going. It'd probably also be one of the biggest spikes in mass murder in recorded history, from all the lost cubs going Crinos in a brief period of time, which may well endanger the Veil if any government types start investigating the trend, though presumably the Technocracy might step in to cover it up - but even then you have to consider that they'd be pretty worried about the sudden jump in shapeshifter numbers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8485-random_interrupt","name":"Random_Interrupt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8485_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T09:23:47-08:00","id":756667,"title":"","content":"There's a lot that depends on the nature of how this inversion occurs.<br /> <br /> For example, is the spike in First Changes relative to Purebreed? Besides the internal political ramifications of an uneven upswing in Changes, it also means that most of the newly increased changes are happening in the most guarded bloodlines (meaning the issue Random_Interrupt raised about deaths and the Veil is less problematic).<br /> <br /> If the spike ignores Purebreed, it would not only have the issues with lots of new Lost Cubs to deal with, but also drastically change the nature of Garou politics. Tribes that are less concerned on average with preserving bloodlines - which are already presented as some of the largest Tribes - would start to dominate the setting by sheer dint of numbers. If the GWs, BGs, and CoGs are producing ~50% of the new cubs because the spike is just as strong for them as it is for the more traditional Tribes, it's an entirely different political situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}